<text x="8.89" y="176.53" size="2.54" layer="97">ESP32-S3-MINI-1U-N8 / 8MB FLASH / NATIVE USB</text>
<text x="10.16" y="43.18" size="1.778" layer="97">Straps: GPIO0 pull-up / BOOT button; GPIO45 pull-down (3.3V flash); GPIO46 pull-down (download enabled); GPIO3 pull-down.</text>
<text x="10.16" y="38.1" size="1.778" layer="97">EN: 10k / 1uF. Module pin 3 decoupled locally by 10u + 100n. All module GND and centre lands bonded to ground plane.</text>
<text x="10.16" y="33.02" size="1.778" layer="97">Module RF connector is Wi-Fi/BLE only, not ELRS. Disable ESP Wi-Fi/BLE during normal ELRS operation.</text>
<text x="10.16" y="27.94" size="1.778" layer="97">ELRS bases: Unified_ESP32S3_2400_TX / RX. Separate firmware images; custom boot role selection and USB RX output required.</text>
</plain>
