<sheet name="">
<plain>
<wire x1="7.62" y1="25.4" x2="271.78" y2="25.4" width="0.3048" layer="97" style="shortdash"/>
<wire x1="271.78" y1="25.4" x2="271.78" y2="180.34" width="0.3048" layer="97" style="shortdash"/>
<wire x1="271.78" y1="180.34" x2="7.62" y2="180.34" width="0.3048" layer="97" style="shortdash"/>
<wire x1="7.62" y1="180.34" x2="7.62" y2="25.4" width="0.3048" layer="97" style="shortdash"/>
<text x="8.89" y="176.53" size="2.54" layer="97">RADIO: SX1280 (Semtech ref.) -&gt; RFX2401C PA/LNA (Skyworks app.) -&gt; LPF -&gt; U.FL</text>
<text x="10.16" y="43.18" size="1.778" layer="97">RF chain: RFIO -&gt; C26 shunt / L3 series (match) -&gt; C27-L4||C28-C29 pi harmonic filter -&gt; C30 DC block (RFIO is DC-biased,</text>
<text x="10.16" y="38.1" size="1.778" layer="97">RFX2401C TXRX is DC-shorted to GND). Values = Semtech reference BOM. SX1280 DC-DC used (L2): ELRS radio_dcdc = true.</text>
<text x="10.16" y="33.02" size="1.778" layer="97">SX1280 output must stay &lt;= +5 dBm (RFX2401C TX input abs max). ELRS power_values limited accordingly.</text>
<text x="152.4" y="48.26" size="1.778" layer="97">FEM control (Skyworks table 6): TXEN=1 TX, TXEN=0/RXEN=1 RX, both 0 = shutdown.</text>
<text x="152.4" y="43.18" size="1.778" layer="97">R19/R20 100k pull-downs hold the FEM in shutdown while the ESP32 is in reset/boot (GPIO hi-Z).</text>
<text x="152.4" y="38.1" size="1.778" layer="97">C33 0.3p at ANT pin (5th harmonic) + 5th-order LC LPF (Skyworks fig 3 option 1). All 50 ohm, 0402.</text>
<text x="152.4" y="33.02" size="1.778" layer="97">R24 = fitted U.FL series link; RF path and LPF must be checked with VNA / spectrum analyzer.</text>
<text x="152.4" y="27.94" size="1.778" layer="97">HCI 52MHz crystal ESR max 60 ohm; Semtech allows up to 90 ohm only if C0 &lt;3pF. HCI family specification C0 &lt;3pF; oscillator startup must be verified in bring-up.</text>
</plain>
